{"id":"4sP0LXxp","slug":"veinminer-enchantment","title":"VeinMiner Enchantment","description":"Veinminer Addon - Adds vineminer enchantment to enchanting tables. Only tools with the enchantment can veinmine","author":"Miraculixx","categories":["datapack","equipment","fabric","folia","game-mechanics","neoforge","paper","purpur","quilt","utility"],"display_categories":["datapack","equipment","fabric","folia","game-mechanics","neoforge","paper","purpur","quilt","utility"],"client_side":"optional","server_side":"required","project_type":"mod","downloads":18008515,"followers":1324,"license":{"id":"LGPL-3.0-only","name":"GNU Lesser General Public License v3.0 only"},"loaders":["datapack","fabric","folia","neoforge","paper","purpur","quilt"],"game_versions":["1.21","1.21.1","1.21.2","1.21.3","1.21.4","1.21.5","1.21.6","1.21.7","1.21.8","1.21.9","1.21.10","1.21.11","26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2","26.3"],"latest_version":"isvS7Giv","date_created":"2024-09-14T13:26:24.954859Z","date_modified":"2026-10-20T13:14:03.941539Z","updated":"2026-10-20T13:14:03.941539Z","color":4211517,"body":"[dono-badge](https://ko-fi.com/miraculixx/donate)\n[![veinminer-badge](/launcher-preview/bodies/4sP0LXxp/0.webp)](https://modrinth.com/mod/veinminer)\n[![client-badge](/launcher-preview/bodies/4sP0LXxp/1.webp)](https://modrinth.com/project/veinminer-client)\n\n## ⛏️ Veinminer Enchantment\n\nAddon for the popular [Veinminer](https://modrinth.com/project/veinminer) mod/plugin/data-pack that limits the use of veinmining to a new custom enchantment `Veinmine`! As long as this addon is installed, veinmining is only possible with the enchantment (still respecting block rules and settings).\n\n## ⚠ Important\n[**Veinminer**](https://modrinth.com/project/veinminer) needs to be installed too for this addon to work!\n\n![Veinmine Enchant on Pickaxe](/launcher-preview/bodies/4sP0LXxp/2.webp)\n\n## ⚙ Settings\n**Fabric/Quilt/NeoForge/Paper/Folia**: use `/veinminer enchant <setting> [<new-value>]` (permission `veinminer.settings`) or edit `config/Veinminer/enchantmentSettings.json` (`plugins/Veinminer/...` for plugins).\nChanges apply after a server restart or world rejoin.<br>\n**DataPack**: open the zip file and navigate to `data/veinminer-enchantment/enchantment/veinminer.json`\n\n|       Setting       |             Default             |                          Description                          |\n|:-------------------:|:-------------------------------:|:-------------------------------------------------------------:|\n|     `maxLevel`      |               `1`               |                 Max level of the enchantment                  |\n|      `weight`       |               `1`               |   How often the enchantment appears (higher -> more common)   |\n|      `minCost`      |              `15`               |        At which level the enchantment appears in table        |\n|  `minCostPerLevel`  |               `0`               |             Added `minCost` per level above first             |\n|      `maxCost`      |              `65`               |    At which level the enchantment stops appearing in table    |\n|  `maxCostPerLevel`  |               `0`               |             Added `maxCost` per level above first             |\n|     `anvilCost`     |               `7`               | How much level combining in anvil costs (stacked with others) |\n|  `supportedItems`   | `#minecraft:enchantable/mining` |         Item or item tag that can get the enchantment         |\n| `inEnchantingTable` |             `true`              |            Enchantment appears in enchanting table            |\n|     `tradeable`     |             `true`              |              Villagers can trade the enchantment              |\n|     `lootable`      |             `true`              |              Enchantment appears in random loot               |\n|     `treasure`      |             `false`             |          Treasure enchantment (doubled trade price)           |\n\nVeinminers `minEnchantLevel` setting (also as group/client override) defines the min enchantment level required to veinmine, e.g. ores only at level 2+.\n\nThe enchantment name is defined by a translatable key `enchantment.veinminer-enchantment.veinminer` and defaults to `Veinmine`.\n\n---\n\n> **Affordable** Servers? In this time?! Clicking below **supports me** and saves you **10%** + 2 Days **free** ♥️\n> [](https://voltra.gg/r/miraculixx) <br>\n> #AD - Your support helps to keep this project alive :)\n\n---","published":"2024-09-14T13:26:24.954859Z","additional_categories":[],"issues_url":null,"source_url":"https://github.com/MiraculixxT/Veinminer","wiki_url":null,"discord_url":"https://dc.mutils.net","donation_urls":[{"platform":"Ko-fi","url":"https://ko-fi.com/miraculixx"}],"team":[{"username":"Miraculixx","role":"Owner","avatar":"/launcher-preview/avatars/Miraculixx.webp"}],"versions_total":26,"gallery":[{"url":"/launcher-preview/galleries/4sP0LXxp/0.webp","featured":true,"title":"Banner","description":null,"created":"2024-09-16T00:21:30.574995Z"},{"url":"/launcher-preview/galleries/4sP0LXxp/1.webp","featured":false,"title":"Enchanting Table Support","description":null,"created":"2024-09-15T13:21:29.011295Z"},{"url":"/launcher-preview/galleries/4sP0LXxp/2.webp","featured":false,"title":"Villiger Support","description":null,"created":"2024-09-15T13:23:20.519507Z"}],"versions":[{"id":"2Y8IKaDH","name":"Veinminer Enchantment - 2.13.0","version_number":"2.13.0","version_type":"release","game_versions":["26.1","26.1.1","26.1.2","26.2","26.3"],"loaders":["fabric","folia","neoforge","paper","purpur","quilt"],"featured":false,"date_published":"2026-10-20T13:14:03.941539Z","downloads":7328,"changelog":"- Add `/veinminer enchant ...` subcommand to edit the enchantment\n- Allow groups to be limited to a min required enchant level (see overrides)\n- Removed paper config","dependencies":[{"project_id":"OhduvhIc","version_id":null,"dependency_type":"required","file_